  "goodToKnow": "Die Perle is a pearl or bead: eine Perlenkette, Glasperlen. Figuratively, it's a gem: Die Stadt ist eine Perle der Ostsee, and a dependable person, especially a domestic helper, was once called eine Perle. Perlen vor die Säue werfen means to cast pearls before swine. Perlen (verb) means to bubble or sparkle: perlender Wein. Hermann Hesse's novel Das Glasperlenspiel (The Glass Bead Game) is a classic."
